<view class="page"><view class="content distributor"><view class="eyebrow">BUBU PIE · PARTNER</view><view class="title">我的推广与收益</view><view class="subtitle">本机演示工作台 · 未接真实账号与转账</view>
  <view wx:if="{{enabled}}"><view class="channel surface"><view class="section-title">{{channel.name}}</view><view class="footnote">分享专属关键词，消费者搜索后领券再购买。</view><view class="keyword-label">我的推广关键词</view><view class="agent-keyword">{{channel.keyword}}</view><view class="footnote">搜索后可领取¥{{channel.value / 100}}无门槛当日券。</view><button class="primary-button" bindtap="copyKeyword">复制推广关键词</button><button class="text-action" bindtap="openPage">预览商城搜索入口 ↗</button></view><view class="stats"><view class="stat surface"><text>原价销售额</text><view>¥{{report.original}}</view></view><view class="stat surface"><text>有效销售额</text><view>¥{{report.net}}</view></view><view class="stat surface"><text>累计有效佣金</text><view>¥{{report.commission}}</view></view><view class="stat surface"><text>可结算</text><view>¥{{report.eligible}}</view></view></view>
  <view class="ledger surface"><view class="row"><text>订单数</text><text>{{report.count}}</text></view><view class="row"><text>退款商品原价</text><text>¥{{report.refund}}</text></view><view class="row"><text>平台用券额（独立统计）</text><text>¥{{report.couponExpense}}</text></view><view class="row"><text>待结算佣金</text><text>¥{{report.pending}}</text></view><view class="row"><text>累计已结算</text><text>¥{{report.settled}}</text></view><view class="row"><text>结算后退款待抵扣</text><text>¥{{report.reversed}}</text></view><button class="primary-button" bindtap="settle">模拟结算</button></view>
  <view class="rule">佣金 = 商品原价合计 × 20%。优惠券由平台承担，不减少佣金；退款冲回对应佣金。确认收货且售后期结束后，才进入可结算。</view>
  <view class="section-title">推广订单</view><view wx:if="{{!orders.length}}" class="empty">先进入专属商城，模拟购买一件商品。</view><view class="order surface" wx:for="{{orders}}" wx:key="id"><view class="row"><text>{{item.id}}</text><text>{{item.status}}</text></view><view class="footnote">原价 ¥{{item.original}} · 平台券 ¥{{item.discount}}</view><view>佣金 ¥{{item.commission}}</view></view>
  <button class="text-action" bindtap="toggleTools">{{showTools ? '收起' : '展开'}}代理演示工具</button><button wx:if="{{showTools}}" class="text-action" bindtap="switchAgent">切换演示代理 A / B</button></view>
  <view wx:else class="empty">代理服务尚未接入，需正式身份认证。</view>
</view></view>
